              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Apu 11:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi atemar kes atiar, “Koloto, konyamata asiepai, komata luewiny, kijukakis akorakineta nin yenimam itemokinitoi ibore: naarai apaaran na nakalaunan mama ejai EJAKAITiwok: kwabo sirikikadakis; naarai aiyalama naka EJAKAIT ŋes agogonokus.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisililinata Ilebin ituŋa kere ebe, “Kililinata, naarai erai apaaran nakalaunan; kwabo sirikikadakis.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolototo ituŋa kere ainyam ka aimat, ka aijukar akorakineta, kaitalakar naepol noi, naarai aienutu akiro nualimonokinio kes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
